  --draft: oneof<nothing, bool> # Indicates whether the pull request is a draft. See "[Draft Pull Requests](https://docs.github.com/enterprise-cloud@latest//articles/about-pull-requests#draft-pull-requests)" in the GitHub Help documentation to learn more.
